# {{lb|en|urban studies}} The process of [[renewal]] and [[rebuilding]] accompanying the [[influx]] of [[middle class]] or [[affluent]] people into [[deteriorating]] areas that often [[displace]]s earlier usually [[poor]]er [[resident]]s.

